# Secret-scanning allowlist (audit SEC-08).
#
# Every entry here is a TEST FIXTURE: a fake credential a detector must be able
# to recognise. Without this file a scanner reports them as leaked secrets, and a
# scanner that cries wolf on its own test data is one people learn to skip.
#
# The rule for adding a line: it must be a value that was never valid anywhere.
# A real credential that has been rotated does NOT belong here, it belongs in a
# rotation record.

# Detector fixtures: the patterns the threat engine must match on.
crates/agent-guard/src/threats.rs
crates/agent-guard/src/redact.rs

# OWASP ASI conformance fixtures.
crates/agent-guard/tests/owasp_asi.rs

# Benchmark corpus: 219 attack and benign cases, including credential-shaped
# strings the rules are scored against.
crates/agent-guard/benchmarks/agent_attack_corpus.yml

# The ATR corpus ships regexes that look like secrets by construction.
rules/atr/
